1
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:48,020
[When I Meet The Moon]

2
00:01:48,090 --> 00:01:51,050
[Episode 26]

3
00:02:01,010 --> 00:02:02,210
You once told me

4
00:02:04,030 --> 00:02:05,030
that looking at me

5
00:02:06,260 --> 00:02:07,860
was like looking at the moon.

6
00:02:12,570 --> 00:02:13,500
But at that time,

7
00:02:18,060 --> 00:02:19,090
I was no longer

8
00:02:19,090 --> 00:02:20,560
the moon you saw before.

9
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:25,590
During that time,

10
00:02:26,750 --> 00:02:27,750
I was

11
00:02:29,460 --> 00:02:30,720
a terrible boyfriend.

12
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:34,090
I had no right to ask you to stay,

13
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:35,930
and I didn't even

14
00:02:35,930 --> 00:02:37,150
apologize to you.

15
00:02:37,810 --> 00:02:38,960
Don't say that. I...

16
00:02:38,980 --> 00:02:40,640
During the time we were apart,

17
00:02:41,030 --> 00:02:42,230
I did a lot of thinking

18
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:44,620
and changed a lot.

19
00:02:48,090 --> 00:02:51,090
So you came back to Xifu because of me?

20
00:02:52,090 --> 00:02:52,680
Yes.

21
00:02:55,460 --> 00:02:56,990
This is what I can do for you,

22
00:02:59,090 --> 00:03:00,950
and what I'm willing to do for you.

23
00:03:07,410 --> 00:03:09,210
You wanted me to go back to school

24
00:03:09,690 --> 00:03:11,290
and return to how I used to be.

25
00:03:12,590 --> 00:03:13,390
Now,

26
00:03:14,900 --> 00:03:16,700
I have become that person again.

27
00:03:22,670 --> 00:03:23,460
Fu Shize.

28
00:03:25,060 --> 00:03:28,190
Actually, there's something
I haven’t told you either.

29
00:03:29,470 --> 00:03:30,840
When I was with you,

30
00:03:31,710 --> 00:03:33,440
I actually felt very inferior.

31
00:03:34,310 --> 00:03:35,310
Whenever you

32
00:03:36,620 --> 00:03:38,630
didn't say or do anything,

33
00:03:39,970 --> 00:03:40,930
I felt that

34
00:03:40,930 --> 00:03:42,990
you didn't like me that much anymore.

35
00:03:45,530 --> 00:03:47,590
When I couldn't reach you back then,

36
00:03:45,760 --> 00:03:47,650
♪ Dreams folded by the rain ♪

37
00:03:47,610 --> 00:03:49,090
I thought you wanted to break up with me

38
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:49,010
♪ Still crystal clear ♪

39
00:03:49,040 --> 00:03:52,270
♪ Clouds stitching up the colors
of every break ♪

40
00:03:50,150 --> 00:03:52,190
because of my dad.

41
00:03:52,290 --> 00:03:54,620
♪ Borrowing a beam of moonlight ♪

42
00:03:53,740 --> 00:03:54,910
When Yun Ye was sick,

43
00:03:54,780 --> 00:03:57,790
♪ To smooth over the uneasy past ♪

44
00:03:54,910 --> 00:03:56,020
I really hoped

45
00:03:56,020 --> 00:03:57,400
you could be by my side.

46
00:03:58,750 --> 00:04:00,870
I didn't know you were sick.

47
00:04:00,170 --> 00:04:02,820
♪ Who is it by my ear ♪

48
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:02,780
I just thought

49
00:04:02,780 --> 00:04:04,680
you didn't like me anymore.

50
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:06,320
♪ Casting shouts into the dark night? ♪

51
00:04:05,630 --> 00:04:06,560
After we broke up,

52
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:07,780
you didn't come looking for me either.

53
00:04:07,040 --> 00:04:11,820
♪ Filling every crack in the clouds ♪

54
00:04:07,780 --> 00:04:08,580
So I thought

55
00:04:09,340 --> 00:04:10,460
that maybe

56
00:04:11,060 --> 00:04:13,120
you'd long wanted to break up with me.

57
00:04:13,450 --> 00:04:16,079
♪ Echoes folding into paper boats ♪

58
00:04:16,100 --> 00:04:19,640
♪ Drifting down the river,
around the shallows ♪

59
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:19,360
Then...

60
00:04:20,100 --> 00:04:25,330
♪ Heading your way, with no turning back ♪

61
00:04:22,130 --> 00:04:23,800
Then why didn't you come to me?

62
00:04:24,430 --> 00:04:25,950
I wanted to.

63
00:04:26,640 --> 00:04:29,360
♪ Burying regrets deep in the soil ♪

64
00:04:27,950 --> 00:04:30,510
I just felt I wasn't good enough.

65
00:04:29,380 --> 00:04:32,540
♪ Waiting for a meeting
to light up the loneliness ♪

66
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:33,120
What I said back then was out of anger.

67
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:34,310
♪ Moonlight gently sways ♪

68
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:34,180
I never really wanted

69
00:04:34,180 --> 00:04:35,390
to break up with you.

70
00:04:34,330 --> 00:04:36,060
♪ Stars fall upon my shoulder ♪

71
00:04:36,090 --> 00:04:38,810
♪ Look at me ♪

72
00:04:36,690 --> 00:04:38,890
I regretted it so much.

73
00:04:38,840 --> 00:04:43,510
♪ The long night slows down ♪

74
00:04:40,420 --> 00:04:41,330
And I was afraid

75
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:43,500
that with my personality,

76
00:04:43,659 --> 00:04:44,890
if I came to you again,

77
00:04:43,990 --> 00:04:45,880
♪ Dreams folded by the rain ♪

78
00:04:45,909 --> 00:04:47,240
♪ Still crystal clear ♪

79
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:46,740
we would

80
00:04:46,740 --> 00:04:48,100
break up again

81
00:04:47,270 --> 00:04:50,500
♪ Clouds stitching up the colors
of every break ♪

82
00:04:48,159 --> 00:04:49,300
because of me.

83
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,750
So I went abroad.

84
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:52,850
♪ Borrowing a beam of moonlight ♪

85
00:04:53,010 --> 00:04:56,020
♪ To smooth over the uneasy past ♪

86
00:04:53,950 --> 00:04:55,010
But this past year,

87
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:57,659
I tried very hard to change myself.

88
00:04:56,050 --> 00:05:03,300
♪ Picking up scattered light
at my fingertips with you ♪

89
00:04:58,480 --> 00:04:59,860
I tried hard to learn

90
00:04:59,860 --> 00:05:01,070
how to communicate with people

91
00:05:01,070 --> 00:05:03,270
and be someone with a good personality.

92
00:05:04,050 --> 00:05:05,690
I tried so hard.

93
00:05:05,970 --> 00:05:07,900
I don't want us to be apart anymore.

94
00:05:14,530 --> 00:05:17,190
♪ My steps drag slow ♪

95
00:05:17,210 --> 00:05:20,320
♪ Spinning where I stand ♪

96
00:05:20,950 --> 00:05:26,010
♪ Like a sail tangled in the night ♪

97
00:05:27,910 --> 00:05:30,440
♪ Answers will come in time ♪

98
00:05:30,460 --> 00:05:33,770
♪ Though the path is rough and unsteady ♪

99
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:39,050
♪ Stubbornness will blow the mist away ♪

100
00:05:40,750 --> 00:05:43,850
♪ Turn around,
listening to the passing crowd ♪

101
00:05:43,880 --> 00:05:46,909
♪ Hesitant unease brushes my face ♪

102
00:05:46,930 --> 00:05:48,560
♪ Fingertips mark the way ♪

103
00:05:48,590 --> 00:05:50,280
♪ Soft rustling sounds arise ♪

104
00:05:50,300 --> 00:05:57,710
♪ Stay with me, no more lost wandering ♪

105
00:05:51,190 --> 00:05:52,060
I'm sorry.

106
00:05:52,830 --> 00:05:54,240
Fu Shize, I'm sorry.

107
00:05:54,450 --> 00:05:56,000
I-If I had

108
00:05:56,980 --> 00:05:58,100
told you all this

109
00:05:58,100 --> 00:05:59,270
back then

110
00:05:58,480 --> 00:06:00,470
♪ The wounds kissed by the wind ♪

111
00:05:59,500 --> 00:06:01,680
instead of overthinking things,

112
00:06:00,490 --> 00:06:01,890
♪ I remember them all ♪

113
00:06:01,910 --> 00:06:05,070
♪ Grains of sand count the depth
of every fall ♪

114
00:06:02,250 --> 00:06:04,160
we wouldn't have broken up.

115
00:06:05,090 --> 00:06:07,400
♪ Still fearing the collision ♪

116
00:06:07,420 --> 00:06:10,670
♪ Like a scorching heat
on a cosmic scale ♪

117
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:12,160
Lili.

118
00:06:11,450 --> 00:06:13,340
♪ Dreams folded by the rain ♪

119
00:06:13,370 --> 00:06:14,700
♪ Still crystal clear ♪

120
00:06:14,730 --> 00:06:17,960
♪ Clouds stitching up the colors
of every break ♪

121
00:06:17,980 --> 00:06:20,310
♪ Borrowing a beam of moonlight ♪

122
00:06:20,390 --> 00:06:25,670
♪ To smooth over the uneasy past ♪

123
00:06:23,430 --> 00:06:25,060
We will never be apart again.

124
00:06:26,730 --> 00:06:33,990
♪ Picking up scattered light
at my fingertips with you ♪

125
00:06:57,040 --> 00:07:04,300
♪ Picking up scattered light
at my fingertips with you ♪

126
00:07:33,659 --> 00:07:34,450
Fu Shize.

127
00:07:38,159 --> 00:07:39,130
Why are you here?

128
00:07:39,130 --> 00:07:40,460
To bring you breakfast.

129
00:07:44,159 --> 00:07:44,950
Let me do it.

130
00:07:45,930 --> 00:07:47,250
Are you super busy today?

131
00:07:47,250 --> 00:07:48,360
You came so early.

132
00:07:50,740 --> 00:07:51,540
It's alright.

133
00:07:51,830 --> 00:07:53,490
I made you fish fillet congee.

134
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,100
The ingredients are at the bottom.

135
00:07:55,100 --> 00:07:55,900
There's a lot.

136
00:07:58,860 --> 00:08:00,750
-It’s a bit hot.
-You didn’t tell me you were coming.

137
00:08:00,750 --> 00:08:02,950
I was afraid of interrupting your work.

138
00:08:03,740 --> 00:08:05,160
Senior, have you eaten?

139
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:06,630
I brought you breakfast.

140
00:08:07,860 --> 00:08:08,860
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

141
00:08:08,860 --> 00:08:09,830
I'll come back later.

142
00:08:09,830 --> 00:08:10,300
No need.

143
00:08:10,300 --> 00:08:11,540
I... I was just about to leave.

144
00:08:11,540 --> 00:08:12,430
I'll leave you to it. I'm leaving.

145
00:08:12,430 --> 00:08:13,010
You're leaving?

146
00:08:13,010 --> 00:08:13,370
Bye-bye.

147
00:08:13,370 --> 00:08:14,070
Leaving so soon?

148
00:08:14,070 --> 00:08:15,330
I'm leaving. Bye-bye.

149
00:08:28,950 --> 00:08:31,610
This egg pancake doesn't taste
as good anymore.

150
00:08:34,700 --> 00:08:37,830
Your girlfriend came all the way
to bring you breakfast?

151
00:08:38,360 --> 00:08:39,150
Jealous?

152
00:08:47,530 --> 00:08:48,340
Get up.

153
00:08:48,530 --> 00:08:49,340
Go eat over there.

154
00:08:49,340 --> 00:08:50,100
I...

155
00:08:51,090 --> 00:08:52,670
Love really does

156
00:08:52,780 --> 00:08:54,180
change people.

157
00:09:13,980 --> 00:09:15,000
I'm heading back now.

158
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,330
See you this afternoon.

159
00:09:17,820 --> 00:09:18,290
Okay.

160
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:25,620
If they give me gifts,

161
00:09:25,620 --> 00:09:26,550
I have to accept them.

162
00:09:26,550 --> 00:09:28,410
Couldn't you just turn them down?

163
00:09:28,500 --> 00:09:30,120
No, they are Yun Li's fans.

164
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:31,130
They like my sister.

165
00:09:31,130 --> 00:09:32,430
I have to be polite to them.

166
00:09:32,430 --> 00:09:33,890
You don't need to explain to me.

167
00:09:33,890 --> 00:09:35,080
I'm not your girlfriend.

168
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:35,790
No matter how many
love letters you receive,

169
00:09:35,790 --> 00:09:37,190
you don't need to tell me.

170
00:09:38,560 --> 00:09:39,200
YY.

171
00:09:39,740 --> 00:09:40,530
Yunyi!

172
00:09:41,940 --> 00:09:42,730
Yun Ye.

173
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:45,650
Coming.

174
00:09:49,700 --> 00:09:50,670
Why are you here?

175
00:09:50,860 --> 00:09:52,860
I came to pass something to Fu Shize.

176
00:09:53,700 --> 00:09:54,830
Don't slam the door!

177
00:09:57,210 --> 00:09:58,160
What's wrong?

178
00:09:58,460 --> 00:09:59,790
Did you fight with Yunyi?

179
00:09:59,790 --> 00:10:00,600
No.

180
00:10:01,530 --> 00:10:02,860
What exactly happened?

181
00:10:03,290 --> 00:10:04,390
I just said hi

182
00:10:04,390 --> 00:10:05,600
to one of your fans.

183
00:10:05,860 --> 00:10:06,650
I didn't say anything else.

184
00:10:06,650 --> 00:10:07,740
And then she got angry.

185
00:10:07,740 --> 00:10:08,840
She also said

186
00:10:08,860 --> 00:10:10,260
she's not my girlfriend.

187
00:10:12,700 --> 00:10:14,150
You two finally

188
00:10:14,150 --> 00:10:15,630
got into the same university

189
00:10:15,630 --> 00:10:17,230
after so many difficulties,

190
00:10:17,460 --> 00:10:20,220
and now you're fighting over
something so trivial?

191
00:10:20,220 --> 00:10:21,370
Fighting is normal.

192
00:10:21,530 --> 00:10:22,840
Who doesn't fight?

193
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:24,030
Yes.

194
00:10:24,030 --> 00:10:25,250
Fighting is normal.

195
00:10:25,250 --> 00:10:26,750
But you shouldn't give each other
the cold shoulder.

196
00:10:26,750 --> 00:10:28,750
You should explain things clearly.

197
00:10:29,130 --> 00:10:30,860
Go quickly. Don't waste time.

198
00:10:33,820 --> 00:10:35,910
Li, take me home for now.

199
00:10:57,340 --> 00:10:58,130
Senior.

200
00:10:58,360 --> 00:10:59,490
Talking about work?

201
00:11:04,650 --> 00:11:05,780
Talking about work?

202
00:11:06,890 --> 00:11:07,820
What do you mean?

203
00:11:08,500 --> 00:11:09,860
Who communicates with their girlfriend

204
00:11:09,860 --> 00:11:11,460
through text messages alone?

205
00:11:11,460 --> 00:11:12,790
Did you two just meet?

206
00:11:24,650 --> 00:11:25,440
Then...

207
00:11:26,610 --> 00:11:28,050
When you are in a relationship,

208
00:11:28,050 --> 00:11:29,380
how do you usually chat?

209
00:11:31,200 --> 00:11:32,730
When I first started dating,

210
00:11:32,730 --> 00:11:35,130
I wished we could
stick together every day.

211
00:11:35,360 --> 00:11:36,360
When we couldn't meet,

212
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:38,020
I would send a WeChat message.

213
00:11:38,140 --> 00:11:39,240
When I was bored,

214
00:11:39,650 --> 00:11:40,910
I would send a sticker.

215
00:11:46,150 --> 00:11:47,790
A sticker?

216
00:11:55,530 --> 00:11:56,440
Send me some.

217
00:11:57,130 --> 00:11:57,940
Senior.

218
00:11:58,460 --> 00:12:00,790
These stickers are a bit too mushy.

219
00:12:00,860 --> 00:12:02,550
Don't send it when you just got together.

220
00:12:02,550 --> 00:12:03,650
Don't scare her.

221
00:12:13,030 --> 00:12:14,130
These stickers

222
00:12:14,130 --> 00:12:15,550
are relatively milder.

223
00:12:16,100 --> 00:12:18,860
You can send the same one a few times.

224
00:12:21,340 --> 00:12:22,130
Thanks.

225
00:13:11,270 --> 00:13:11,980
Yunyi!

226
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:15,150
I'm sorry.

227
00:13:15,630 --> 00:13:16,860
Whether I did anything wrong or not,

228
00:13:16,860 --> 00:13:18,460
just treat it all as my fault.

229
00:13:18,940 --> 00:13:20,140
What did you do wrong?

230
00:13:20,250 --> 00:13:21,360
As long as you think it's wrong,

231
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:22,360
then it's wrong.

232
00:13:26,670 --> 00:13:28,150
Yin Yunyi,

233
00:13:28,460 --> 00:13:29,360
I'm sorry.

234
00:13:29,530 --> 00:13:30,790
Given my good attitude

235
00:13:30,790 --> 00:13:32,130
in admitting my mistakes,

236
00:13:32,130 --> 00:13:33,750
can you stop being angry?

237
00:13:36,740 --> 00:13:37,630
Wait a minute.

238
00:13:40,100 --> 00:13:42,160
Do you remember the stars you gave me?

239
00:13:44,460 --> 00:13:46,150
I gave you this jar.

240
00:13:53,390 --> 00:13:55,130
And this jar is...

241
00:13:56,130 --> 00:13:57,460
I folded these.

242
00:14:01,700 --> 00:14:03,160
You know how to fold stars?

243
00:14:04,250 --> 00:14:05,290
I didn't before.

244
00:14:05,560 --> 00:14:07,290
I learned how to after you left.

245
00:14:07,700 --> 00:14:09,390
Since you went to Nanwu,

246
00:14:09,570 --> 00:14:10,860
every time I missed you,

247
00:14:10,860 --> 00:14:11,860
I folded one.

248
00:14:14,860 --> 00:14:15,790
So many.

249
00:14:17,530 --> 00:14:18,860
I decided a long time ago

250
00:14:19,290 --> 00:14:20,050
that I'd give this to you

251
00:14:20,050 --> 00:14:21,030
when I officially confessed

252
00:14:21,030 --> 00:14:22,150
my feelings to you.

253
00:14:40,100 --> 00:14:41,700
Why is this one so big?

254
00:14:43,250 --> 00:14:45,510
Because there's a secret hidden inside.

255
00:14:58,800 --> 00:15:01,020
Yin Yunyi from Class 15 of Grade 11,

256
00:15:01,500 --> 00:15:02,580
there is something

257
00:15:02,870 --> 00:15:04,320
Yun Ye wants to tell you.

258
00:15:05,270 --> 00:15:06,390
I like you.

259
00:15:12,100 --> 00:15:14,890
Will you be my girlfriend?

260
00:15:19,550 --> 00:15:21,890
So, will you say yes?

261
00:15:26,340 --> 00:15:27,130
Really?

262
00:15:28,780 --> 00:15:30,880
You really said yes? You said yes!

263
00:15:31,320 --> 00:15:32,290
Yes! Yes!

264
00:15:32,290 --> 00:15:33,250
Yes!

265
00:15:34,150 --> 00:15:35,360
Yes!

266
00:15:36,050 --> 00:15:38,170
I did it! I did it!

267
00:15:40,550 --> 00:15:41,940
I did it! I did it...

268
00:15:42,720 --> 00:15:43,510
Yunyi.

269
00:15:52,340 --> 00:15:53,340
Want to write one?

270
00:15:53,940 --> 00:15:54,530
Yeah.

271
00:15:57,340 --> 00:15:58,940
There are sticky notes here.

272
00:15:59,610 --> 00:16:01,010
You should write one too.

273
00:16:13,750 --> 00:16:14,790
N-No peeking.

274
00:16:15,550 --> 00:16:16,360
It's a secret.

275
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:20,000
Okay.

276
00:16:20,360 --> 00:16:22,290
Then you can't look at mine either.

277
00:16:23,630 --> 00:16:24,460
I won't look.

278
00:16:31,680 --> 00:16:32,470
Fu Shize.

279
00:16:32,500 --> 00:16:33,940
In the future, when this wish of ours

280
00:16:33,940 --> 00:16:34,860
comes true,

281
00:16:34,860 --> 00:16:36,840
we'll come back to see it, okay?

282
00:16:36,940 --> 00:16:37,740
Okay.

283
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:41,790
I'm done.

284
00:16:42,860 --> 00:16:43,920
Put yours up first.

285
00:16:55,340 --> 00:16:56,130
Done.

286
00:16:56,390 --> 00:16:57,200
I'll help you.

287
00:16:57,200 --> 00:16:57,740
No need.

288
00:16:57,740 --> 00:16:58,740
I'll do it myself.

289
00:16:59,460 --> 00:17:00,440
Turn around.

290
00:17:00,460 --> 00:17:01,250
No peeking.

291
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:10,640
Done.

292
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:12,500
I'm done.

293
00:17:12,589 --> 00:17:13,349
Let's go.

294
00:17:13,349 --> 00:17:14,440
Where did you paste it?

295
00:17:14,440 --> 00:17:15,460
Nowhere.

296
00:17:18,740 --> 00:17:19,530
Yin.

297
00:17:19,660 --> 00:17:21,790
Do you have any plans to return to Xifu?

298
00:17:22,050 --> 00:17:22,849
Of course.

299
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:24,730
After all, this is my hometown.

300
00:17:24,940 --> 00:17:26,550
Our company is planning to set up

301
00:17:26,550 --> 00:17:27,740
a research department in Xifu.

302
00:17:27,740 --> 00:17:28,750
After a while,

303
00:17:28,750 --> 00:17:30,280
I'll go back to work in Xifu.

304
00:17:30,460 --> 00:17:31,250
That's good.

305
00:17:31,500 --> 00:17:32,670
It's good for young people

306
00:17:32,670 --> 00:17:34,220
to be ambitious.

307
00:17:35,400 --> 00:17:36,200
You're back.

308
00:17:36,240 --> 00:17:37,750
Come, sit down.

309
00:17:40,230 --> 00:17:41,470
Let me tell you, Yin.

310
00:17:42,520 --> 00:17:43,030
As for me,

311
00:17:43,030 --> 00:17:44,600
although I'm not highly educated,

312
00:17:44,600 --> 00:17:45,810
I'm quite satisfied

313
00:17:45,840 --> 00:17:47,350
with the children I've raised.

314
00:17:47,350 --> 00:17:48,950
Uncle, you're being modest.

315
00:17:49,940 --> 00:17:51,590
Lili, get us some fruit.

316
00:17:52,140 --> 00:17:53,290
I'll go with Yun Ye.

317
00:17:53,290 --> 00:17:54,090
Okay.

318
00:17:57,790 --> 00:17:58,900
What's going on?

319
00:17:59,290 --> 00:18:00,440
You haven't confessed yet, right?

320
00:18:00,440 --> 00:18:02,140
Why is Yunyi's brother already here?

321
00:18:02,140 --> 00:18:03,270
It's not about that.

322
00:18:03,330 --> 00:18:04,960
If not that, then what?

323
00:18:06,210 --> 00:18:08,090
My future sister-in-law's
family is so strict.

324
00:18:08,090 --> 00:18:10,490
They're visiting
before you even confess.

325
00:18:10,590 --> 00:18:11,290
Yun Ye.

326
00:18:11,520 --> 00:18:12,870
Maybe when you confess,

327
00:18:12,900 --> 00:18:13,750
Dad will even throw you

328
00:18:13,750 --> 00:18:14,960
a big banquet.

329
00:18:15,230 --> 00:18:16,590
It's not impossible.

330
00:18:16,700 --> 00:18:17,500
In your dreams.

331
00:18:17,500 --> 00:18:18,590
I'm just kidding.

332
00:18:18,760 --> 00:18:20,000
You're way off.

333
00:18:20,130 --> 00:18:21,990
It's not about me. It's about you.

334
00:18:22,250 --> 00:18:24,180
He's here for a blind date with you.

335
00:18:26,540 --> 00:18:27,800
Yin Yucheng and me?

336
00:18:29,640 --> 00:18:31,000
What's this about a blind date?

337
00:18:31,000 --> 00:18:31,880
I'll go clear things up.

338
00:18:31,880 --> 00:18:32,680
Wait, wait...

339
00:18:32,750 --> 00:18:33,810
Li, take it easy.

340
00:18:34,030 --> 00:18:35,700
Don't ruin my happiness.

341
00:18:39,240 --> 00:18:40,050
Mr. Yin.

342
00:18:40,640 --> 00:18:41,440
I'm sorry.

343
00:18:41,900 --> 00:18:43,110
This blind date

344
00:18:43,140 --> 00:18:44,740
must be a misunderstanding.

345
00:18:45,960 --> 00:18:46,750
Yun Li.

346
00:18:46,960 --> 00:18:47,740
What are you doing?

347
00:18:47,740 --> 00:18:48,800
You're being rude.

348
00:18:49,050 --> 00:18:50,290
I don't want a blind date.

349
00:18:50,290 --> 00:18:51,290
And I don't need one.

350
00:18:51,290 --> 00:18:52,830
I've told you many times.

351
00:18:53,500 --> 00:18:54,290
Uncle.

352
00:18:54,940 --> 00:18:56,740
There must be a misunderstanding.

353
00:18:56,740 --> 00:18:57,530
Actually, Yun Li and I

354
00:18:57,530 --> 00:18:58,850
have known each other for a long time.

355
00:18:58,850 --> 00:19:00,900
I mainly came today to pay you a visit

356
00:19:01,350 --> 00:19:02,750
and invite you to dinner.

357
00:19:03,330 --> 00:19:05,310
Unfortunately, I also have
an appointment today.

358
00:19:05,310 --> 00:19:06,800
I'll find another time

359
00:19:06,820 --> 00:19:08,220
to treat you two to a meal.

360
00:19:11,640 --> 00:19:12,750
Yin, look.

361
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:14,660
Sorry you had to witness that.

362
00:19:14,660 --> 00:19:15,590
When you go home,

363
00:19:15,660 --> 00:19:18,260
please apologize to your parents
on my behalf.

364
00:19:18,310 --> 00:19:18,980
It's fine.

365
00:19:19,140 --> 00:19:20,680
I won't bother you two anymore.

366
00:19:20,680 --> 00:19:21,090
Okay.

367
00:19:21,720 --> 00:19:22,720
I'll walk you out.

368
00:19:30,550 --> 00:19:31,350
Okay.

369
00:19:43,590 --> 00:19:44,400
Yun Li.

370
00:19:45,140 --> 00:19:46,530
Where did you learn

371
00:19:46,530 --> 00:19:47,550
to be this rude?

372
00:19:48,550 --> 00:19:49,370
Dad, I've told you

373
00:19:49,370 --> 00:19:50,460
more than once.

374
00:19:50,770 --> 00:19:51,700
I don't want to go on blind dates,

375
00:19:51,700 --> 00:19:52,880
and I don't need blind dates.

376
00:19:52,880 --> 00:19:54,350
Can you stop making decisions for me?

377
00:19:54,350 --> 00:19:55,810
Making decisions for you?

378
00:19:56,030 --> 00:19:57,250
If you don't want me to interfere,

379
00:19:57,250 --> 00:19:57,940
bring back a

380
00:19:57,940 --> 00:19:59,250
decent boyfriend.

381
00:19:59,740 --> 00:20:00,640
Yin

382
00:20:01,660 --> 00:20:03,030
is highly educated and has a good job.

383
00:20:03,030 --> 00:20:04,900
The key is that he's from Xifu.

384
00:20:04,900 --> 00:20:05,700
And he doesn't mind

385
00:20:05,700 --> 00:20:06,590
that you're deaf in one ear!

386
00:20:06,590 --> 00:20:07,330
Dear!

387
00:20:10,140 --> 00:20:10,940
Yes.

388
00:20:11,290 --> 00:20:12,530
He has great qualifications,

389
00:20:12,530 --> 00:20:14,410
while your daughter can't hear in one ear.

390
00:20:14,410 --> 00:20:15,380
I won't put you in an awkward position.

391
00:20:15,380 --> 00:20:16,290
I'll make it clear to him myself.

392
00:20:16,290 --> 00:20:16,960
Lili!

393
00:20:18,000 --> 00:20:18,610
Dad.

394
00:20:18,940 --> 00:20:20,250
You've gone too far.

395
00:20:20,530 --> 00:20:21,390
Can you please consider

396
00:20:21,390 --> 00:20:22,460
Li's feelings?

397
00:20:24,500 --> 00:20:25,290
Senior Yin.

398
00:20:30,750 --> 00:20:32,140
Actually, Fu Shize and I

399
00:20:32,140 --> 00:20:33,140
are still dating.

400
00:20:33,860 --> 00:20:35,110
I didn't tell my dad.

401
00:20:38,200 --> 00:20:39,000
That's great.

402
00:20:39,940 --> 00:20:41,000
I wish you the best.

403
00:20:42,250 --> 00:20:44,000
I've told my dad many times,

404
00:20:44,020 --> 00:20:45,420
but he just won't listen.

405
00:20:46,050 --> 00:20:47,850
I'm really sorry about just now.

406
00:20:47,850 --> 00:20:48,910
It was so rude of us.

407
00:20:49,400 --> 00:20:50,200
It's fine.

408
00:20:50,940 --> 00:20:52,400
I was being presumptuous.

409
00:20:52,570 --> 00:20:55,030
When I heard the matchmaker
describe this person,

410
00:20:55,030 --> 00:20:56,690
I thought it sounded like you.

411
00:20:56,830 --> 00:20:58,090
So I took a chance

412
00:20:58,090 --> 00:20:58,950
and came to see.

413
00:21:03,240 --> 00:21:04,370
I guess losing to him

414
00:21:05,500 --> 00:21:07,160
doesn't sting quite so much.

415
00:21:28,590 --> 00:21:29,940
Are you free now?

416
00:21:36,920 --> 00:21:37,510
Lili.

417
00:21:40,960 --> 00:21:43,020
Why did you come here so late at night?

418
00:21:50,240 --> 00:21:51,040
What's wrong?

419
00:21:51,830 --> 00:21:52,790
I missed you.

420
00:21:56,330 --> 00:21:57,750
Didn't we just part ways?

421
00:21:58,200 --> 00:21:59,330
You miss me already?

422
00:22:03,900 --> 00:22:04,700
What's wrong?

423
00:22:08,830 --> 00:22:09,790
What happened?

424
00:22:10,700 --> 00:22:11,500
It's my dad.

425
00:22:12,250 --> 00:22:13,460
He's so ridiculous.

426
00:22:13,460 --> 00:22:14,240
He invited Yin Yucheng over

427
00:22:14,240 --> 00:22:15,590
to set me up on a blind date.

428
00:22:15,590 --> 00:22:16,350
I had a fight with him

429
00:22:16,350 --> 00:22:17,410
and left the house.

430
00:22:19,840 --> 00:22:20,700
I just feel that

431
00:22:21,240 --> 00:22:22,000
since I was a child,

432
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:24,800
I've never been able
to communicate well with him.

433
00:22:26,140 --> 00:22:28,560
When I was young,
it was because of my studies.

434
00:22:28,560 --> 00:22:30,090
As I grew older, he started deciding

435
00:22:30,090 --> 00:22:31,460
which university I should attend,

436
00:22:31,460 --> 00:22:32,530
what major I should choose,

437
00:22:32,530 --> 00:22:33,990
and what job I should take.

438
00:22:34,700 --> 00:22:35,500
Now,

439
00:22:35,790 --> 00:22:37,740
he's even arranging blind dates for me.

440
00:22:37,740 --> 00:22:38,460
I've already told him

441
00:22:38,460 --> 00:22:39,660
I don't need it and don't want to go,

442
00:22:39,660 --> 00:22:41,060
but he just won't listen.

443
00:22:43,250 --> 00:22:44,270
I can understand

444
00:22:44,270 --> 00:22:45,730
why he treats me like this.

445
00:22:45,740 --> 00:22:47,830
He thinks I've been introverted

446
00:22:48,290 --> 00:22:49,240
since I was a child,

447
00:22:49,240 --> 00:22:50,830
that I'm stubborn

448
00:22:51,050 --> 00:22:52,850
and can't get along with others.

449
00:22:52,960 --> 00:22:53,940
So he arranges everything

450
00:22:53,940 --> 00:22:55,240
perfectly for me.

451
00:22:55,400 --> 00:22:56,530
But growing up,

452
00:22:56,530 --> 00:22:57,660
I've always been working hard

453
00:22:57,660 --> 00:22:59,140
to tell him that

454
00:22:59,140 --> 00:22:59,960
even if I'm introverted,

455
00:22:59,960 --> 00:23:00,460
it doesn't mean

456
00:23:00,460 --> 00:23:01,750
I can't get along well with others.

457
00:23:01,750 --> 00:23:02,350
It doesn't mean

458
00:23:02,350 --> 00:23:03,790
I can't take good care of myself

459
00:23:03,790 --> 00:23:04,940
or make choices

460
00:23:04,940 --> 00:23:05,800
for my own life.

461
00:23:16,400 --> 00:23:17,140
Lili.

462
00:23:18,000 --> 00:23:19,570
I think your father

463
00:23:19,960 --> 00:23:20,920
probably hasn't seen

464
00:23:20,920 --> 00:23:21,920
your efforts yet.

465
00:23:22,860 --> 00:23:23,670
I believe that

466
00:23:23,690 --> 00:23:24,740
if he sees

467
00:23:25,290 --> 00:23:26,660
you've grown up

468
00:23:27,160 --> 00:23:27,960
and can make

469
00:23:27,960 --> 00:23:29,220
decisions on your own,

470
00:23:29,700 --> 00:23:30,900
he'll change.

471
00:23:32,900 --> 00:23:34,830
But I'm just really angry today.

472
00:23:35,290 --> 00:23:36,620
Do you know what he said?

473
00:23:38,030 --> 00:23:38,890
What did he say?

474
00:23:40,240 --> 00:23:41,700
He said Yin Yucheng

475
00:23:41,700 --> 00:23:43,050
is highly educated and has a good job,

476
00:23:43,050 --> 00:23:43,500
and doesn't mind

477
00:23:43,500 --> 00:23:44,900
that I'm deaf in one ear.

478
00:23:45,200 --> 00:23:46,030
He just wants to find me a family

479
00:23:46,030 --> 00:23:47,000
that won't look down on me,

480
00:23:47,000 --> 00:23:47,790
so I won't be mistreated

481
00:23:47,790 --> 00:23:48,990
after I marry into it.

482
00:23:52,830 --> 00:23:53,750
Your father really

483
00:23:53,750 --> 00:23:55,210
shouldn't have said that.

484
00:23:55,440 --> 00:23:57,300
I'm quite angry hearing that too.

485
00:23:58,460 --> 00:24:00,660
Why can't I hear the anger in your voice?

486
00:24:09,350 --> 00:24:10,010
Lili.

487
00:24:14,030 --> 00:24:15,030
Don't doubt yourself

488
00:24:15,030 --> 00:24:16,960
just because of others' opinions.

489
00:24:17,740 --> 00:24:19,140
You are very independent

490
00:24:19,530 --> 00:24:20,390
and ambitious.

491
00:24:21,700 --> 00:24:23,500
And you've achieved everything

492
00:24:23,590 --> 00:24:24,590
you wanted to do,

493
00:24:25,350 --> 00:24:26,160
haven't you?

494
00:24:27,900 --> 00:24:28,700
Have I?

495
00:24:28,940 --> 00:24:29,770
Of course.

496
00:24:32,830 --> 00:24:33,590
Parents

497
00:24:33,830 --> 00:24:35,230
have their own thoughts.

498
00:24:36,950 --> 00:24:37,760
Maybe

499
00:24:38,120 --> 00:24:38,840
those thoughts

500
00:24:38,840 --> 00:24:40,140
aren't perfect,

501
00:24:40,740 --> 00:24:42,800
and maybe we can't accept all of them.

502
00:24:43,660 --> 00:24:45,060
But parents are parents,

503
00:24:45,640 --> 00:24:46,640
and we are us.

504
00:24:47,330 --> 00:24:48,260
Don't you agree?

505
00:24:51,660 --> 00:24:52,360
Besides,

506
00:24:55,330 --> 00:24:56,140
in my eyes,

507
00:24:57,160 --> 00:24:57,960
you've always been someone

508
00:24:57,960 --> 00:24:58,850
who shines

509
00:25:00,590 --> 00:25:01,750
and never loses her sparkle

510
00:25:01,750 --> 00:25:03,480
just because others doubt her.

511
00:25:14,500 --> 00:25:15,830
Let me tell you a secret.

512
00:25:18,400 --> 00:25:20,750
Actually, your dad is just stubborn.

513
00:25:21,400 --> 00:25:23,460
You must be very special in his heart.

514
00:25:24,390 --> 00:25:25,180
That's why

515
00:25:26,640 --> 00:25:27,590
he was so against

516
00:25:27,590 --> 00:25:29,190
us being together last time.

517
00:25:31,090 --> 00:25:33,370
Don't listen to his nonsense.

518
00:25:33,500 --> 00:25:34,940
He just doesn't know you.

519
00:25:35,850 --> 00:25:36,710
Don't mind him.

520
00:25:37,200 --> 00:25:38,030
I don't mind.

521
00:25:39,460 --> 00:25:41,120
I only care about the present.

522
00:25:41,400 --> 00:25:42,350
And whether you're happy

523
00:25:42,350 --> 00:25:43,200
or sad,

524
00:25:44,700 --> 00:25:46,230
I'll always be by your side.

525
00:25:52,290 --> 00:25:55,640
Aren't you worried about my strict dad?

526
00:25:59,940 --> 00:26:00,700
I wouldn't dare speak ill

527
00:26:00,700 --> 00:26:02,300
of my future father-in-law.

528
00:26:07,740 --> 00:26:08,800
Let's find a chance

529
00:26:09,590 --> 00:26:10,590
for me to meet him.

530
00:26:11,460 --> 00:26:13,110
You don't mind how

531
00:26:13,140 --> 00:26:14,540
he treated you last time?

532
00:26:16,890 --> 00:26:17,680
As for that,

533
00:26:18,430 --> 00:26:20,090
you can't entirely blame him.

534
00:26:21,090 --> 00:26:22,680
I wasn't in a good state back then.

535
00:26:22,680 --> 00:26:23,530
Besides,

536
00:26:24,640 --> 00:26:25,350
he was just

537
00:26:25,350 --> 00:26:26,810
protecting his daughter.

538
00:26:27,850 --> 00:26:28,750
But if his protection

539
00:26:28,750 --> 00:26:29,740
hurts you,

540
00:26:32,220 --> 00:26:34,280
I'll bring you home as my wife sooner.

541
00:26:40,050 --> 00:26:41,590
I haven't agreed yet.

542
00:26:43,660 --> 00:26:45,240
Even if my dad agrees later,

543
00:26:45,240 --> 00:26:46,640
I might not.

544
00:26:49,290 --> 00:26:50,090
Then

545
00:26:50,550 --> 00:26:52,140
I'll just wait until you do.

546
00:26:55,940 --> 00:26:57,540
Why are you so pure-hearted?

547
00:26:59,300 --> 00:27:00,160
Pure-hearted?

548
00:27:29,790 --> 00:27:31,190
Am I still pure-hearted?

549
00:27:32,010 --> 00:27:33,480
That's not included.

550
00:27:42,330 --> 00:27:43,930
Alright, it's getting late.

551
00:27:44,330 --> 00:27:45,460
Let me take you home.

552
00:27:48,000 --> 00:27:49,290
Let's go home.

553
00:27:50,700 --> 00:27:51,960
I don't want to go back.

554
00:28:26,830 --> 00:28:27,960
Li, where did you go?

555
00:28:28,070 --> 00:28:30,070
Why didn't you reply to my messages?

556
00:28:33,090 --> 00:28:33,700
What's wrong?

557
00:28:33,700 --> 00:28:35,560
You didn't even read my messages?

558
00:28:35,890 --> 00:28:36,950
I didn't read them.

559
00:28:38,900 --> 00:28:39,630
You're back.

560
00:28:40,750 --> 00:28:42,210
The noodles are still hot.

561
00:28:42,350 --> 00:28:44,080
I'll go heat up the soup for you.

562
00:28:45,200 --> 00:28:46,010
Sit down, Li.

563
00:28:46,330 --> 00:28:46,920
Sit.

564
00:28:48,070 --> 00:28:48,590
Sit.

565
00:28:49,960 --> 00:28:50,900
I'll go help Dad.

566
00:29:13,330 --> 00:29:14,270
Say it.

567
00:29:16,720 --> 00:29:18,530
Say it, hurry up.

568
00:29:24,010 --> 00:29:25,010
I...

569
00:29:28,160 --> 00:29:29,030
I did this

570
00:29:29,030 --> 00:29:30,460
all for your own good.

571
00:29:36,450 --> 00:29:37,430
Dad, I've heard this

572
00:29:37,430 --> 00:29:39,500
so many times my left ear is calloused.

573
00:29:39,500 --> 00:29:40,420
Then you should know

574
00:29:40,420 --> 00:29:41,090
that I'm doing this

575
00:29:41,090 --> 00:29:42,240
all for your sake.

576
00:29:42,350 --> 00:29:43,250
With your temper and personality,

577
00:29:43,250 --> 00:29:44,500
if you end up in someone else's household

578
00:29:44,500 --> 00:29:45,210
and they wrong you,

579
00:29:45,210 --> 00:29:46,750
you'll just be stubborn and keep quiet.

580
00:29:46,750 --> 00:29:47,550
Dear.

581
00:29:49,640 --> 00:29:51,000
Didn't we agree

582
00:29:51,000 --> 00:29:52,640
to talk nicely?

583
00:29:57,250 --> 00:29:59,450
Actually, I'm already dating someone.

584
00:30:00,250 --> 00:30:01,200
So please don't arrange these

585
00:30:01,200 --> 00:30:02,090
blind dates for me anymore.

586
00:30:02,090 --> 00:30:03,000
It's not good.

587
00:30:03,200 --> 00:30:04,750
You have a boyfriend?

588
00:30:06,330 --> 00:30:07,110
Lili.

589
00:30:09,290 --> 00:30:10,750
Since when?

590
00:30:11,160 --> 00:30:11,940
Why didn't I hear

591
00:30:11,940 --> 00:30:13,200
you mention it?

592
00:30:13,790 --> 00:30:15,000
Just recently.

593
00:30:15,590 --> 00:30:16,750
I wanted to wait until it was stable

594
00:30:16,750 --> 00:30:17,880
before telling you.

595
00:30:18,960 --> 00:30:20,850
See? I told you not to rush it.

596
00:30:20,940 --> 00:30:22,590
You should have asked her first.

597
00:30:22,590 --> 00:30:23,500
Yes, yes.

598
00:30:23,530 --> 00:30:25,260
Look at the mess you made today.

599
00:30:25,940 --> 00:30:27,660
Wait, who are you dating?

600
00:30:28,340 --> 00:30:29,900
The teaching assistant in Yun Ye's class.

601
00:30:29,900 --> 00:30:31,060
A PhD student at XUST.

602
00:30:31,060 --> 00:30:32,000
He's graduating soon.

603
00:30:32,000 --> 00:30:32,790
Really?

604
00:30:34,290 --> 00:30:35,090
Really.

605
00:30:36,400 --> 00:30:37,810
So how is he?

606
00:30:39,590 --> 00:30:40,460
He's very nice.

607
00:30:41,050 --> 00:30:42,310
He treats me very well.

608
00:30:42,770 --> 00:30:44,200
Why didn't you say so earlier?

609
00:30:44,200 --> 00:30:45,200
When you have time,

610
00:30:45,200 --> 00:30:46,090
bring him over

611
00:30:46,090 --> 00:30:47,420
so we can meet him, okay?

612
00:30:47,900 --> 00:30:49,610
Dad, don't worry so much.

613
00:30:49,610 --> 00:30:50,660
What if you scare

614
00:30:50,660 --> 00:30:51,530
my sister's boyfriend away?

615
00:30:51,530 --> 00:30:52,640
Am I that scary?

616
00:30:52,640 --> 00:30:53,570
I won't eat him.

617
00:30:53,790 --> 00:30:55,090
What's there to be scared of?

618
00:30:55,090 --> 00:30:56,700
Is he not good enough for my daughter?

619
00:30:56,700 --> 00:30:57,710
No.

620
00:30:57,740 --> 00:30:59,790
Our teaching assistant is very impressive.

621
00:30:59,790 --> 00:31:01,390
He did his undergrad at XUST.

622
00:31:01,720 --> 00:31:02,310
And

623
00:31:02,310 --> 00:31:03,590
he gets national scholarships every year.

624
00:31:03,590 --> 00:31:05,010
He often wins first place in competitions.

625
00:31:05,010 --> 00:31:06,050
He's a really nice person,

626
00:31:06,050 --> 00:31:07,380
and he has a good temper.

627
00:31:07,590 --> 00:31:08,240
Also,

628
00:31:08,380 --> 00:31:09,810
he's very devoted.

629
00:31:09,810 --> 00:31:11,400
He's deeply in love with Li.

630
00:31:12,640 --> 00:31:14,500
Wait, if this boy is so excellent,

631
00:31:14,830 --> 00:31:16,290
has he never dated anyone?

632
00:31:17,480 --> 00:31:19,140
He's never dated anyone else.

633
00:31:22,460 --> 00:31:23,900
Sounds good.

634
00:31:24,520 --> 00:31:26,180
He's a good match for our Lili.

635
00:31:26,460 --> 00:31:27,250
Right, Dear?

636
00:31:28,140 --> 00:31:28,940
Yes.

637
00:31:29,290 --> 00:31:31,140
Then it's worth celebrating.

638
00:31:31,170 --> 00:31:31,780
Hey, Yun Ye,

639
00:31:31,780 --> 00:31:32,800
bring me my wine.

640
00:31:48,140 --> 00:31:48,990
Not bad.

641
00:31:50,220 --> 00:31:52,110
Dad, when you said "not bad,"

642
00:31:52,110 --> 00:31:53,110
did you mean the wine

643
00:31:53,110 --> 00:31:55,070
or my sister's boyfriend?

644
00:31:56,140 --> 00:31:56,940
Both.

645
00:32:07,250 --> 00:32:08,530
After achieving millimeter-level

646
00:32:08,530 --> 00:32:10,850
dynamic reconstruction of facial muscles,

647
00:32:10,850 --> 00:32:11,660
currently,

648
00:32:11,790 --> 00:32:12,660
our multimodal

649
00:32:12,660 --> 00:32:13,790
interaction system

650
00:32:13,790 --> 00:32:14,940
is nearing completion.

651
00:32:14,940 --> 00:32:15,940
On this basis,

652
00:32:16,160 --> 00:32:17,400
the applications of digital twins

653
00:32:17,400 --> 00:32:18,860
will be greatly expanded.

654
00:32:19,240 --> 00:32:20,030
Of course,

655
00:32:20,030 --> 00:32:21,000
in this field,

656
00:32:21,000 --> 00:32:22,400
we still have many key issues

657
00:32:22,400 --> 00:32:23,240
to solve,

658
00:32:23,590 --> 00:32:26,240
such as the risk of emotional dependence

659
00:32:26,440 --> 00:32:28,030
and the possibility of memory tampering.

660
00:32:28,030 --> 00:32:29,030
These challenges

661
00:32:29,500 --> 00:32:31,030
involve ethical safeguards

662
00:32:31,030 --> 00:32:32,430
and technical stability.

663
00:32:32,430 --> 00:32:33,830
They will also be our next

664
00:32:33,830 --> 00:32:35,350
key targets to overcome.

665
00:32:45,200 --> 00:32:46,000
Alright.

666
00:32:46,030 --> 00:32:47,090
That's all for today.

667
00:32:47,090 --> 00:32:48,020
Let's eat first.

668
00:32:48,830 --> 00:32:50,030
What did I say?

669
00:32:50,050 --> 00:32:51,160
Now that Senior is dating,

670
00:32:51,160 --> 00:32:52,760
we can finally catch a break.

671
00:32:56,740 --> 00:32:57,460
For me?

672
00:32:57,590 --> 00:32:58,160
Yes.

673
00:32:58,960 --> 00:32:59,850
For us.

674
00:33:01,770 --> 00:33:02,590
Sister-in-law,

675
00:33:02,590 --> 00:33:04,050
we'll go have our meals.

676
00:33:04,400 --> 00:33:05,500
Eat more, Senior.

677
00:33:10,750 --> 00:33:12,050
I always take up so much

678
00:33:12,050 --> 00:33:13,200
