683
00:33:22,000 --> 00:33:23,260
Then what should we do?

684
00:33:23,700 --> 00:33:24,700
What should we do?

685
00:33:25,270 --> 00:33:27,140
You're exercising
your rights as a girlfriend.

686
00:33:27,140 --> 00:33:28,340
Who cares about them?

687
00:33:28,590 --> 00:33:29,250
Have a seat.

688
00:33:29,880 --> 00:33:31,000
I'm just saying.

689
00:33:34,290 --> 00:33:35,590
Hurry up and eat,

690
00:33:36,090 --> 00:33:38,220
or you'll get stomach problems again.

691
00:33:41,700 --> 00:33:42,900
Hello, Ms. Yun Li.

692
00:33:42,900 --> 00:33:44,750
You have passed our company's
recruitment assessment.

693
00:33:44,750 --> 00:33:45,480
Welcome to

694
00:33:45,480 --> 00:33:47,340
the Yousheng Technology family.

695
00:33:47,380 --> 00:33:48,430
I got the offer.

696
00:33:49,460 --> 00:33:49,980
Look.

697
00:33:50,180 --> 00:33:51,510
I previously went for an interview

698
00:33:51,510 --> 00:33:52,900
at Yousheng Technology.

699
00:33:52,900 --> 00:33:53,590
They started a

700
00:33:53,590 --> 00:33:54,030
project group

701
00:33:54,030 --> 00:33:55,160
focused on VR games.

702
00:33:55,160 --> 00:33:56,420
It's related to Mr. Xu.

703
00:33:58,790 --> 00:33:59,750
Do you want to go?

704
00:34:00,610 --> 00:34:01,250
Yeah.

705
00:34:01,790 --> 00:34:02,350
I worked at

706
00:34:02,350 --> 00:34:03,440
EAW before,

707
00:34:03,440 --> 00:34:05,830
so it'll definitely be easier
for me to get started.

708
00:34:05,830 --> 00:34:07,570
I'm really interested in it.

709
00:34:10,400 --> 00:34:11,230
Sure,

710
00:34:11,460 --> 00:34:13,050
as long as you're interested.

711
00:34:13,050 --> 00:34:15,590
But if I go,

712
00:34:16,719 --> 00:34:18,850
we'll have less time to see each other.

713
00:34:21,260 --> 00:34:22,320
It doesn't matter.

714
00:34:22,370 --> 00:34:23,179
Anyway, I'll be

715
00:34:23,179 --> 00:34:24,900
busy with my doctoral thesis later,

716
00:34:24,900 --> 00:34:27,050
so I probably won't have much time either.

717
00:34:27,050 --> 00:34:28,050
It doesn't matter?

718
00:34:28,050 --> 00:34:28,440
Hey...

719
00:34:28,440 --> 00:34:30,670
We'll have less time to see each other.

720
00:34:31,170 --> 00:34:32,780
Won't you miss me?

721
00:34:33,500 --> 00:34:34,530
Won't you miss me?

722
00:34:37,030 --> 00:34:38,030
Of course I will.

723
00:34:38,900 --> 00:34:40,460
I'll pick you up from work
every day from now on.

724
00:34:40,460 --> 00:34:41,090
Okay?

725
00:34:42,610 --> 00:34:43,190
Okay.

726
00:34:44,030 --> 00:34:46,650
Then I'll also come to see you often

727
00:34:47,030 --> 00:34:48,500
before I start working.

728
00:34:51,630 --> 00:34:53,090
Eat your food, boyfriend.

729
00:35:08,050 --> 00:35:08,760
What's wrong?

730
00:35:08,760 --> 00:35:10,840
I might need to report to you

731
00:35:12,300 --> 00:35:14,190
that I can't have dinner with you.

732
00:35:15,230 --> 00:35:17,690
The company has a welcome party.
I have to go.

733
00:35:20,300 --> 00:35:21,090
Alright.

734
00:35:21,760 --> 00:35:23,090
Eat dinner by yourself.

735
00:35:23,760 --> 00:35:24,960
What about tomorrow?

736
00:35:25,310 --> 00:35:26,100
Tomorrow?

737
00:35:26,960 --> 00:35:28,090
We'll see tomorrow.

738
00:35:31,760 --> 00:35:32,190
You know,

739
00:35:32,190 --> 00:35:33,000
it has a very laid-back vibe.

740
00:35:33,000 --> 00:35:33,980
Sorry I'm late.

741
00:35:34,280 --> 00:35:35,010
Here you are.

742
00:35:35,360 --> 00:35:36,840
I was delayed by a meeting.

743
00:35:36,840 --> 00:35:37,860
Then you have to drink a penalty cup.

744
00:35:37,860 --> 00:35:39,660
Team Leader, you always do this.

745
00:35:41,260 --> 00:35:42,360
You must be Yun Li.

746
00:35:42,400 --> 00:35:43,190
Yes.

747
00:35:43,310 --> 00:35:44,100
Nice to meet you.

748
00:35:44,100 --> 00:35:45,230
I'm the team leader, Zhou Tiao.

749
00:35:45,230 --> 00:35:46,550
Welcome to our big family.

750
00:35:46,550 --> 00:35:47,590
Hello, Team Leader.

751
00:35:47,590 --> 00:35:48,760
Hello, Team Leader.

752
00:35:48,760 --> 00:35:49,940
My name is Yang Chao.

753
00:35:50,000 --> 00:35:51,550
I graduated
from the Industrial Design program

754
00:35:51,550 --> 00:35:52,300
at XUST.

755
00:35:52,400 --> 00:35:53,340
XUST?

756
00:35:53,860 --> 00:35:54,800
Then aren't you and the Team Leader

757
00:35:54,800 --> 00:35:55,760
alumni?

758
00:35:55,760 --> 00:35:56,440
Yang,

759
00:35:56,460 --> 00:35:57,620
we are not only alumni,

760
00:35:57,620 --> 00:35:58,520
but you are also my junior

761
00:35:58,520 --> 00:35:59,650
from the same major.

762
00:36:01,520 --> 00:36:02,310
Team Leader,

763
00:36:02,500 --> 00:36:04,050
you used to study hardware?

764
00:36:04,650 --> 00:36:06,530
So why are you making games now?

765
00:36:07,500 --> 00:36:08,590
By chance, I guess.

766
00:36:09,550 --> 00:36:11,260
Isn't cross-disciplinary popular now?

767
00:36:11,260 --> 00:36:12,900
I studied landscape planning in college

768
00:36:12,900 --> 00:36:14,700
and taught myself programming.

769
00:36:15,630 --> 00:36:16,570
Let me tell you,

770
00:36:16,960 --> 00:36:18,600
it's not that I disliked it.

771
00:36:18,620 --> 00:36:20,150
I really liked making hardware.

772
00:36:20,150 --> 00:36:21,360
My classmates and I even formed

773
00:36:21,360 --> 00:36:22,860
a drone racing team.

774
00:36:23,130 --> 00:36:24,610
I know, it's

775
00:36:24,610 --> 00:36:25,570
Team Unique.

776
00:36:25,610 --> 00:36:27,070
Team Leader, I remember that

777
00:36:27,070 --> 00:36:29,270
you were a founding member at that time.

778
00:36:29,920 --> 00:36:30,850
I was young then.

779
00:36:30,960 --> 00:36:31,690
On a whim,

780
00:36:31,690 --> 00:36:32,940
I formed a drone team.

781
00:36:34,300 --> 00:36:36,060
At that time, there were people
from all majors:

782
00:36:36,060 --> 00:36:37,060
automation,

783
00:36:37,240 --> 00:36:38,270
industrial design,

784
00:36:38,270 --> 00:36:39,260
even communications.

785
00:36:39,260 --> 00:36:40,690
It was pure passion.

786
00:36:40,690 --> 00:36:41,630
At first,

787
00:36:41,630 --> 00:36:42,940
we made racing drones.

788
00:36:42,940 --> 00:36:43,460
Later, we participated in

789
00:36:43,460 --> 00:36:44,590
the drone design competition

790
00:36:44,590 --> 00:36:46,390
and won first place nationally.

791
00:36:46,840 --> 00:36:47,980
Our wish at that time

792
00:36:48,010 --> 00:36:49,270
was to win every trophy

793
00:36:49,300 --> 00:36:50,150
there was.

794
00:36:50,650 --> 00:36:51,960
Then, since you liked it so much,

795
00:36:51,960 --> 00:36:52,530
why didn't you

796
00:36:52,530 --> 00:36:54,870
continue making drones after graduation?

797
00:36:54,870 --> 00:36:55,660
Back then,

798
00:36:55,860 --> 00:36:57,920
something happened to a team member.

799
00:36:58,350 --> 00:37:00,170
The captain took a leave of absence
because of it,

800
00:37:00,170 --> 00:37:02,500
and the whole team eventually fell apart.

801
00:37:03,190 --> 00:37:05,750
Then, why did the captain

802
00:37:06,000 --> 00:37:07,330
take a leave of absence?

803
00:37:08,230 --> 00:37:09,860
The teammate who had the accident

804
00:37:09,860 --> 00:37:10,530
and the captain

805
00:37:10,530 --> 00:37:12,590
had grown up together like brothers.

806
00:37:13,110 --> 00:37:13,920
Maybe

807
00:37:14,630 --> 00:37:16,210
he couldn't take the blow.

808
00:37:17,680 --> 00:37:19,150
Why am I getting off-topic?

809
00:37:19,150 --> 00:37:20,230
I'll have a drink as punishment.

810
00:37:20,230 --> 00:37:20,650
We'll drink with you.

811
00:37:20,650 --> 00:37:21,050
We'll drink with you.

812
00:37:21,050 --> 00:37:21,670
We toast you.

813
00:37:21,670 --> 00:37:22,050
Right.

814
00:37:22,050 --> 00:37:23,070
Cheers.

815
00:37:27,650 --> 00:37:28,900
What made you think of

816
00:37:28,900 --> 00:37:30,030
picking me up today?

817
00:37:31,960 --> 00:37:34,090
When the girlfriend is out for dinner,

818
00:37:34,150 --> 00:37:34,940
shouldn't her boyfriend

819
00:37:34,940 --> 00:37:35,870
come pick her up?

820
00:37:40,420 --> 00:37:41,220
What's wrong?

821
00:37:44,210 --> 00:37:45,010
Nothing.

822
00:37:49,490 --> 00:37:50,450
Were you unhappy

823
00:37:51,500 --> 00:37:52,430
at dinner today?

824
00:37:53,260 --> 00:37:54,050
No.

825
00:37:57,000 --> 00:37:57,550
Mm.

826
00:37:58,130 --> 00:37:58,940
That's good.

827
00:37:59,840 --> 00:38:00,630
By the way,

828
00:38:01,840 --> 00:38:04,270
our team leader was your classmate.

829
00:38:05,400 --> 00:38:07,230
On his keychain,

830
00:38:07,550 --> 00:38:08,000
there was a

831
00:38:08,000 --> 00:38:08,610
Unique

832
00:38:08,610 --> 00:38:09,420
badge.

833
00:38:13,860 --> 00:38:14,650
What's

834
00:38:16,190 --> 00:38:17,000
his name?

835
00:38:18,590 --> 00:38:19,430
Zhou Tiao.

836
00:38:27,130 --> 00:38:28,130
He's a nice guy.

837
00:38:28,960 --> 00:38:30,230
Working under him

838
00:38:31,500 --> 00:38:33,100
should be a good experience.

839
00:38:38,860 --> 00:38:40,520
Should I look for another job?

840
00:38:41,130 --> 00:38:41,570
I still have

841
00:38:41,570 --> 00:38:42,190
many offers

842
00:38:42,190 --> 00:38:43,920
that I haven't turned down yet.

843
00:38:45,630 --> 00:38:46,650
It's okay.

844
00:38:47,900 --> 00:38:48,670
Zhou Tiao

845
00:38:53,000 --> 00:38:54,250
and Jiang Yuan

846
00:38:55,230 --> 00:38:55,960
both used to be

847
00:38:55,960 --> 00:38:57,000
my best friends.

848
00:38:58,460 --> 00:38:59,260
Together, we founded

849
00:38:59,260 --> 00:39:00,000
Unique.

850
00:39:03,170 --> 00:39:04,830
After Jiang Yuan passed away,

851
00:39:08,710 --> 00:39:11,240
these teammates reached out
to me many times.

852
00:39:11,860 --> 00:39:12,760
But I never knew

853
00:39:13,900 --> 00:39:15,320
how to face them.

854
00:39:19,230 --> 00:39:19,900
Lili,

855
00:39:22,460 --> 00:39:23,260
I'm sorry.

856
00:39:24,550 --> 00:39:25,750
I should have told you

857
00:39:27,420 --> 00:39:28,960
